<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Cổng Thông Tin Nội Bộ - Nhóm 8 E-Commerce</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #4f46e5;
      --primary-light: #6366f1;
      --primary-dark: #3730a3;
      --accent: #06b6d4;
      --success: #10b981;
      --warning: #f59e0b;
      --pink: #ec4899;
      --bg-main: #f8fafc;
      --bg-card: #ffffff;
      --text-main: #0f172a;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --radius: 16px;
      --shadow-sm: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      --shadow-md: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      --shadow-hover: 0 18px 30px -10px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.14);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-main);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1220px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .nav-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      height: 70px;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .logo-badge {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #9333ea);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3);
    }

    .brand-text h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .brand-text p {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 22px;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .status-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: #065f46;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background-color: var(--success);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 1; }
      100% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      padding: 50px 0 30px;
      text-align: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12) 0%, transparent 60%);
    }

    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 99px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 2.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #ec4899);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 11px 22px;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #6366f1);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background: white;
      color: var(--text-main);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Stats Banner */
    .stats-bar {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 36px;
      background: white;
      padding: 20px 28px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .stat-item {
      text-align: center;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .stat-item:last-child {
      border-right: none;
    }

    .stat-number {
      font-size: 1.65rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* Main Grid Layout */
    .main-content {
      padding: 35px 0 10px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      transition: all 0.25s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .about-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef2ff 0%, #faf5ff 100%);
      border: 1px solid #c7d2fe;
    }

    .about-box h3 {
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .about-box p {
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .tag-list {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .tag-item {
      background: white;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--primary);
      border: 1px solid #e0e7ff;
    }

    /* Product Grid */
    .category-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .cat-card {
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .cat-icon-svg {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      background: #e0e7ff;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--primary);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .cat-card h4 {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .cat-card p {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* Fanpage Section */
    .fanpage-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .fanpage-cover {
      height: 110px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1877f2, #00c6ff);
    }

    .fanpage-body {
      padding: 0 20px 20px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .fanpage-avatar {
      width: 70px;
      height: 70px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 4px solid white;
      background: #4f46e5;
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      position: absolute;
      top: -35px;
      left: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    }

    .fanpage-header-info {
      padding-top: 42px;
    }

    .fanpage-name {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .verified-badge {
      color: #1877f2;
      display: inline-flex;
    }

    .fanpage-handle {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .fanpage-bio {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #475569;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .fanpage-metrics {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .metric-col {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .metric-val {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .metric-title {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .social-btn {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 11px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .fb-btn { background: #1877f2; color: white; }
    .fb-btn:hover { background: #166fe5; }
    .shopee-btn { background: #ee4d2d; color: white; }
    .shopee-btn:hover { background: #d73211; }
    .tiktok-btn { background: #000000; color: white; }
    .tiktok-btn:hover { background: #222222; }

    /* =========================================================
       SƠ ĐỒ TRUNG TÂM: GIÁM ĐỐC Ở GIỮA, 4 GÓC XUNG QUANH & THƯ KÝ
    ========================================================= */
    .org-section {
      padding: 50px 0 60px;
    }

    .org-header {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 36px;
    }

    .org-header h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .org-header p {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* 3-Column Diagram Layout */
    .org-diagram-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.35fr 1fr;
      gap: 22px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .org-col {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    /* Department Cards (4 Corners) */
    .corner-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .corner-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
    }

    .corner-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 4px;
      height: 100%;
    }

    /* Color borders */
    .corner-sales::before { background: var(--success); }
    .corner-mktg::before { background: var(--pink); }
    .corner-it::before { background: var(--accent); }
    .corner-acct::before { background: var(--warning); }

    .corner-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .corner-icon {
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .icon-sales { background: #d1fae5; color: #059669; }
    .icon-mktg { background: #fce7f3; color: #db2777; }
    .icon-it { background: #cffafe; color: #0891b2; }
    .icon-acct { background: #fef3c7; color: #d97706; }

    .role-badge {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .badge-sales { color: #059669; }
    .badge-mktg { color: #db2777; }
    .badge-it { color: #0891b2; }
    .badge-acct { color: #d97706; }

    .person-name {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-main);
      text-transform: uppercase; /* In hoa chuẩn */
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .corner-desc {
      font-size: 0.83rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    /* Center Column (Director + Secretaries) */
    .center-col {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* Executive Director Card */
    .director-center-card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e1b4b 60%, #312e81 100%);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 36px -8px rgba(30, 27, 75, 0.45);
      border: 2px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .director-crown {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fbbf24, #d97706);
      color: #78350f;
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin: 0 auto 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
    }

    .director-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.15);
      color: #fef08a;
      border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.35);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .director-title {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: #93c5fd;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .director-name {
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-transform: uppercase; /* In hoa */
      letter-spacing: 0.6px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .director-bio {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #c7d2fe;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .director-status-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }

    /* Secretaries Card (Trực thuộc Giám đốc) */
    .secretary-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #c7d2fe;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .secretary-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: #eff6ff;
      color: var(--primary);
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .secretary-names {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .sec-name-pill {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-main);
      text-transform: uppercase; /* In hoa */
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    .sec-desc {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      background: white;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 36px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-content p {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* Responsive Design */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .main-content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .org-diagram-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .center-col {
        order: -1; /* Đưa giám đốc lên đầu trên mobile để dễ nhìn */
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 1.95rem;
      }
      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header>
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a href="#" class="brand-logo">
        <div class="logo-badge">N8</div>
        <div class="brand-text">
          <h2>Server Nội Bộ - Nhóm 8</h2>
          <p>E-Commerce Operations Portal</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#about">Về Doanh Nghiệp</a></li>
        <li><a href="#channels">Kênh Bán Hàng</a></li>
        <li><a href="#fanpage">Fanpage</a></li>
        <li><a href="#org-chart">Cơ Cấu Tổ Chức</a></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="status-badge">
        <span class="status-dot"></span>
        <span>Server Trực Tuyến 24/7</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-tag">⚡ HỆ THỐNG VẬN HÀNH THƯƠNG MẠI ĐIỆN TỬ D2C</div>
      <h1>Chào Mừng Đến Với<br><span>Server Nội Bộ - Nhóm 8</span></h1>
      <p>Cổng thông tin số tập trung: Quản trị luồng vận hành đơn hàng, dữ liệu phân phối và liên kết đội ngũ nhân sự chủ chốt Nhóm 8.</p>
      
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#org-chart" class="btn btn-primary">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
          Sơ Đồ Ban Lãnh Đạo
        </a>
        <a href="#fanpage" class="btn btn-outline">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z"></path></svg>
          Fanpage Chính Thức
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Metrics -->
      <div class="stats-bar">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">1.250+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Đơn Hàng / Tháng</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">98.8%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Giao Hàng Đúng Hạn</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">4.9 ★</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Đánh Giá Hài Lòng Khách Hàng</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">&lt; 3 Phút</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Tốc Độ Phản Hồi Tin Nhắn</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content Layout -->
  <main class="container main-content">
    
    <!-- Left Column: Business & Operations Info -->
    <section>
      
